{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOJIBO</strong> is a relaxing, <strong>two-player-only</strong> co-op platformer where two robots, T0J1 and J1B0, must work together to climb to the top. Explore the remains of a fallen civilization as these two robot friends, still functioning from a bygone era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch co-op:</strong> Grab two controllers and a friend, then enjoy the climb together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op:</strong> Thanks to rollback netcode, enjoy smooth online play with no input latency or desyncs, even if you're continents apart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrying is caring:</strong> The core mechanic revolves around carrying and throwing. Haul a wild range of objects and throw them at useful targets. You can even carry your partner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Puzzles are designed for fun cooperation, not frustration!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809740?t=1756717679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809740?t=1756717679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/a78e55707feb016113f6cc559a2fe35f2e1689e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756717679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809740/a78e55707feb016113f6cc559a2fe35f2e1689e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756717679","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}